18. What causes rebalances?
Common causes include:
Consumer joins
new instance deployed
Consumer leaves
graceful shutdown
Consumer failure
crash
network failure
Polling problems
processing takes too long
Subscription changes
topic subscription changes
So rebalancing is normal.
Constant rebalancing is not.
________________________________________
19. Rebalance storm
Imagine Kubernetes is repeatedly restarting pods:
C1 joins
 ↓
rebalance

C2 crashes
 ↓
rebalance

C2 joins
 ↓
rebalance

C3 crashes
 ↓
