38. Kafka performance mental model
When performance is bad, walk through this:
                Throughput problem
                       │
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        ↓              ↓              ↓
     Producer        Broker        Consumer
        │              │              │
    batching       CPU/disk       fetch batch
    compression    network        processing
    partitions     replication    lag
Then ask:
Is CPU saturated?
Is disk saturated?
Is network saturated?
Are partitions skewed?
Are consumers slow?
Is compression expensive?
Is replication consuming bandwidth?
Are batches too small?
This is much better than randomly changing Kafka properties.
